  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-043">Disposition routability stays single-sourced in the DispositionRoutability registry — verify the compose flip needs NO registry change (compose already routable); if it does, coordinate with notification-spine-r1's registry work. Scope: the flip.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-040">Store-before-render preserved; the findings branch consumes ComposeLedgerOutputDto {key,bindingId,turn,disposition,payload} as-is — no new ledger shape. Scope: the materializer.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Metadata preservation is the point: the re-materialized gutter must carry riskLevel/sectionRef/standardRef/flaggedClause/assessment — route via placeAdvisoryComments, NOT registerAiReviewComments. Scope: the findings branch.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Idempotency: reuse the lastMaterializedKey guard — a findings payload materializes once per load; server code changes require explicit §10 justification (none expected).</constraint>
  </constraints>

